        "original_id": "0f355c91-59ab-54a4-8cb2-10c2b630e93d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Concepts: humanzee, chimpanzee-human hybrid\n- Products: Chuman, Manpanzee\n- Systems: Homo sapiens sapiens, Pan\n- Topics: chimpanzees, great apes, genus Pan\n\nFacts:\n- The humanzee is a hypothetical hybrid between Homo sapiens sapiens and Pan.\n- The humanzee is also known as the Chuman or the Manpanzee.\n- Chimpanzees, or chimps, are great apes in the genus Pan.\n- Chimpanzees consist of two species: the common chimpanzee and the bonobo.",
